<title>USA: Keystone says Q1 bookings highest in history.</title>
<headline>Keystone says Q1 bookings highest in history.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keystone International Inc said Tuesday that its first quarter bookings represent the highest level of orders in the company's history.</p>
<p>Keystone International said it expects to realize improved profitability through the remainder of the year as shipment levels increase and cost containment initiatives continue to produce results.</p>
</text>
